<title>USA: AMBAC qualifies four municipal bond issues.</title>
<headline>AMBAC qualifies four municipal bond issues.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>AMBAC Indemnity Corp said on Monday that it qualified for bond insurance the following four municipal bond issues set for competitive sale.</p>
<p>--Des Plaines, Ill., General Obligations (GOs), Tax, $5.030 million.</p>
<p>--Des Plaines, Ill., GOs, Corp. Purpose, $3 million.</p>
<p>--Des Plaines, Ill., GO, $1.210 million.</p>
<p>--Consolidated Fire District #2, Kan., GOs, $2.5 million.</p>
<p>--Garden City, Mich., Special Assessment, $5 million.</p>
<p>--Garden City, Mich., Special Assessment, $4.935 million.</p>
<p>--Chittenango C.S.D., N.Y., School District, $4.125 million.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
